        },
        {
          "text": " Batabani ba Efuraimu: Shuseela, mwene Shuseela ni Beredi, mwne Beredi ni Tahasi, mwene Tahasi ni Eleada, mwene Eleada ni Tahasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwene Tahasi ni zabadi, mwene Zabadi ni Shuseela, kandi na Ezeri na Eleada abaitsirwe abashaija ba Gaasi abazaariirwe omuri egyo nsi, ahabw'okuba bakashuumayo kunyaga ente zaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Efuraimu ishebo yaamara ebiro bingi naabacurira, beene ishe baija kumugumya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku haahingwireho ebiro, Efuraimu yaabyama n'omukazi we, omukazi yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Beria, ahakuba enju ye ekaguubwaho akabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
