          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ebibanja byabo n'ebi baabaire batungire bikaba biri Beseeli n'omu ndembo zaayo, aha bukiizi bw'oburugwa-izooba Narani, aha burengyerwa-izooba Gezeri n'endembo zaayo, Shekemu n'endembo zaayo na Aaza n'endembo zaayo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
