              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi n'aha myatano y'Abamanaase Besi-sheani n'endembo zaayo, Tanaki n'endembo zaayo na Doori n'endembo zaayo. Omuri ezo ndembo beene Yosefu mwene Israeli nimwo baabaire batwire.",
          "type": "text",
